    "body": "Hi,\n\nI'm using Cloudflare's CDN service, which may cause IP duplication, and I can't control the IP address assigned to me by CF.\n\n```\n; <<>> DiG diggui.com <<>> @8.8.8.8 tracker.renfei.net A\n; (1 server found)\n;; global options: +cmd\n;; Got answer:\n;; ->>HEADER<<- opcode: QUERY, status: NOERROR, id: 38609\n;; flags: qr rd ra; QUERY: 1, ANSWER: 3, AUTHORITY: 0, ADDITIONAL: 1\n\n;; OPT PSEUDOSECTION:\n; EDNS: version: 0, flags:; udp: 512\n;; QUESTION SECTION:\n;tracker.renfei.net.\t\tIN\tA\n\n;; ANSWER SECTION:\ntracker.renfei.net.\t600\tIN\tCNAME\ttracker.renfei.eu.org.\ntracker.renfei.eu.org.\t300\tIN\tA\t104.21.58.176\ntracker.renfei.eu.org.\t300\tIN\tA\t172.67.162.102\n\n;; Query time: 74 msec\n;; SERVER: 8.8.8.8#53(8.8.8.8)\n;; WHEN: Sun Mar 16 09:19:15 UTC 2025\n;; MSG SIZE  rcvd: 114\n```\n\n104.21.58.176 and 172.67.162.102 belong to https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v4/",
